{"lines":[{"w":0.086440626780192042,"h":0.018865451040297576,"c":1,"x":0.81900443702956216,"t":"Reading","y":0.036708548779274097},{"h":0.015988371899566145,"t":"READING PASSAGE 2","y":0.087209302417152412,"x":0.069902914747051931,"w":0.30679611206054691,"c":1},{"h":0.019029377256969737,"w":0.82330098470052071,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 14-26, which are based on Reading","x":0.069902905602396856,"y":0.12645348864602535,"c":1},{"t":"Passage 2 below.","w":0.16699029286702471,"c":1,"h":0.016021879439784725,"y":0.14534883729477144,"x":0.069902911701316031},{"y":0.18300224694908052,"w":0.43915506998697912,"c":1,"x":0.26585155176502667,"t":"Living with artificial intelligence","h":0.025258781456873103},{"w":0.80399566650390619,"x":0.08343655224307743,"h":0.020799050969869559,"y":0.22495189211698885,"t":"Powerful artificial intelligence (AI) needs to be reliably aligned with human values, but","c":1},{"h":0.020008833460347319,"c":1,"x":0.29302353079745919,"w":0.4023348236083984,"t":"does this mean Al will eventually have to","y":0.24253932240659781},{"y":0.2617220071670272,"h":0.018894843223310476,"c":1,"x":0.38618068353606211,"t":"police those values?","w":0.19655249277750647},{"c":1,"t":"This has been the decade of Al, with one astonishing feat after another. A chess-","x":0.067961169143053626,"h":0.017507969627499231,"w":0.75728154500325517,"y":0.30087209291033912},{"c":1,"x":0.067961153343141512,"t":"playing Al that can defeat not only all human chess players, but also all previous","w":0.7533980814615886,"h":0.017583134018372193,"y":0.31962616841536029},{"w":0.82135920206705726,"y":0.33707165085175439,"h":0.019033000030992842,"x":0.066019428053774434,"c":1,"t":"human-programmed chess machines, after learning the game in just four hours? That's"},{"h":0.017519742306147723,"x":0.06601940774722001,"y":0.35755813942199244,"w":0.80388351440429684,"t":"yesterday's news, what's next? True, these prodigious accomplishments are all in so-","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.067895952002406265,"y":0.37473531182569331,"w":0.80206563313802082,"t":"called narrow Al, where machines perform highly specialised tasks. But many experts","h":0.019384748987691047},{"h":0.023781029531888764,"x":0.067830873942294548,"t":"believe this restriction is very temporary. By mid-century, we may have artificial general","w":0.81576090494791653,"c":1,"y":0.39222845268869366},{"t":"intelligence (AGI) - machines that can achieve human-level performance on the full","h":0.017459972773756993,"c":1,"x":0.064077665332797365,"y":0.41277258547352069,"w":0.78640777587890631},{"h":0.015988371899566145,"t":"range of tasks that we ourselves can tackle.","w":0.41747573852539061,"c":1,"x":0.066019411976862161,"y":0.43168604658976539},{"x":0.066019415758081831,"y":0.46791277245695428,"t":"If so, there's little reason to think it will stop there. Machines will be free of many of","w":0.77475728352864592,"c":1,"h":0.019005831899672643},{"t":"the physical constraints on human intelligence. Our brains run at slow biochemical","y":0.48691588790319829,"w":0.77475728352864581,"x":0.066019416398376246,"h":0.017445482866043527,"c":1},{"x":0.067877504241290201,"w":0.75548563639322908,"y":0.5050334115075078,"c":1,"h":0.021129295610564425,"t":"processing speeds on the power of a light bulb, and their size is restricted by the"},{"h":0.019924368219583655,"c":1,"w":0.82732371012369788,"y":0.52401971967614902,"t":"dimensions of the human birth canal. It is remarkable what they accomplish, given these","x":0.067885298223790372},{"y":0.54360465104924693,"t":"handicaps. But they may be as far from the physical limits of thought as our eyes are","c":1,"h":0.017454538909816963,"w":0.79611648559570303,"x":0.066019426969605777},{"x":0.066019405509705198,"w":0.49708740234375004,"t":"trom the incredibly powerful Webb Space Telescope.","y":0.56250000009304457,"h":0.016004672897196204,"c":1},{"y":0.59679021652653375,"x":0.067829543687530525,"w":0.76141530354817699,"t":"Once machines are better than us at designing even smarter machines, progress","h":0.021464127395011912,"c":1},{"x":0.064010556808602723,"y":0.61724451202764774,"w":0.80789021809895845,"c":1,"h":0.017747494587645685,"t":"towards these limits could accelerate. What would this mean for us? Could we ensure"},{"h":0.022737563659097515,"c":1,"t":"a safe and worthwhile coexistence with such machines? On the plus side, Al is already","x":0.065911118019383916,"y":0.63353416683777974,"w":0.8157743326822916},{"w":0.83727325439453137,"h":0.026689257280106182,"c":1,"x":0.065870377746277409,"t":"useful and profitable for many things, and super Al might be expected to be super useful,","y":0.65068264669851827},{"h":0.017481707041137384,"c":1,"w":0.82135920206705726,"t":"and super profitable. But the more powerful Al becomes, the more important it will be to","x":0.066019427969147462,"y":0.67441860453782065},{"x":0.065976535354833263,"y":0.69087369198603066,"t":"specify its goals with great care. Folklore is full of tales of people who ask for the wrong","h":0.01990349671550995,"w":0.81757893880208332,"c":1},{"x":0.064002920817021525,"w":0.78266240437825518,"h":0.020389549754490366,"c":1,"t":"thing, with disastrous consequences - King Midas, for example, might have wished","y":0.70976134940454849},{"h":0.019003115264797477,"w":0.78446604410807286,"y":0.72959501571146979,"t":"that everything he touched turned to gold, but didn't really intend this to apply to his","x":0.064077657432118448,"c":1},{"w":0.097141602834065741,"t":"breakfast.","c":1,"x":0.065992305275584404,"y":0.74845419603284558,"h":0.016173003247222373},{"c":1,"x":0.0659532017567553,"y":0.78317862684045503,"w":0.80984171549479167,"h":0.020733923035618718,"t":"So we need to create powerful Al machines that are 'human-friendly' - that have goals"},{"t":"reliably aligned with our own values. One thing that makes this task difficult is that","x":0.064037305238613465,"h":0.018830254813221092,"y":0.80371791093135903,"w":0.77096028645833325,"c":1},{"w":0.79999999999999993,"t":"we are far from reliably human-friendly ourselves. We do many terrible things to each","y":0.82267441849001,"h":0.017512497352291101,"x":0.066019417320752991,"c":1},{"x":0.065938045899120348,"t":"other and to many other creatures with whom we share the planet. If superintelligent","c":1,"w":0.79239878336588543,"y":0.84025043824111667,"h":0.01960779350494668},{"h":0.017470839907447133,"x":0.064077678670736493,"t":"machines don't do a lot better than us, we'l be in deep trouble. We'll have powerful new","y":0.86043613694436916,"c":1,"w":0.82718444824218751},{"w":0.60582524617513023,"t":"intelligence amplifying the dark sides of our own fallible natures.","c":1,"h":0.017524270030939704,"x":0.062135920482794517,"y":0.87936046500228504},{"x":0.8718446611134808,"y":0.95494186058743424,"w":0.029126211802164681,"t":"43","h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1}],"h":3209,"w":2400}